Z||000000||ponya||06-20-2000||02:52 PM||||I'm pretty new to working on Fiero's, but I used to restore 280Z cars. We used to use Red Line synthetic in our manual and auto transmissions. They really help to smooth things out with the older transmissions. Any one use any of these products. If so, how were the results?  Thanks  Bob||||reg||1
Z||000001||tgowens||06-20-2000||03:26 PM||||Hello Bob, Red Line is all I use - transmission as well as oil. I am satisfied with the synthetics and I will tell you this - that's all the Fiero Shop  <A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.net/" TARGET=_blank>www.fieroshop.net/</A>  uses in the cars they service.........<p>[This message has been edited by tgowens (edited 06-21-2000).]||||reg||1
